<title>USA: Suzuki May US car sales fall.</title>
<headline>Suzuki May US car sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Suzuki Motor Corp</p>
<p>			May 1-31, 1997     May 1-31, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car		 111		 176	    -36.9</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	     523		 617	    -15.2</p>
<p> Import Car		   479		 491	     -2.4</p>
<p> Import Truck	     1,339	     1,025	    +30.6</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-May 31, 1997 Jan 1-May 31, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car		 741	     1,983	    -62.3</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	   2,051	     3,524	    -41.3</p>
<p> Import Car		 3,713	     2,697	    +38.7</p>
<p> Import Truck	     6,431	     6,077	     +6.7</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 26 in latest month vs 26, 128 for year to date vs 129 in year ago.</p>
</text>
